<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese construction sector more confident - INE.</title>
<headline>Portuguese construction sector more confident - INE.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute (INE) said its indicator measuring the level of confidence in the construction and public works sector rose in August, extending a positive trend that began in the second quarter of the year.</p>
<p>The indicator, for which it gives no figures, takes into account the level of activity, the views of businessmen in the sector about future orders and the outlook for employment.</p>
<p>INE said the sector where the positive trend was less marked, although still positive, was in the housing sector.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
